 x + 2 \\le 8 \\[5pt]\n\t4 \\,{\\color{red}-}\\, {\\color{red}{2}} &\\le x + 2 \\,{\\color{red}-}\\, {\\color{red}{2}} \\le 8 \\,{\\color{red}-}\\, {\\color{red}{2}} \\[5pt]\n\t2 &\\le x \\le 6\n}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $2 \\le x \\le 6.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186070018 #edb/ref 1065 8677 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186070018 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "6d8fae47-5e67-5793-a585-d3781d5c4555" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186070018 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049534 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1037 #edb/ref 17592186049844 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083554 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083623 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186506600 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1039 "Graphing a Vertical Translation" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186082947 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083189 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "61ec00a6-06ae-5d78-bb1a-b06351432cc3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083624 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083676 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186506528 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186570741 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186570773 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1039 "Graphing a Horizontal Translation" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1041 #edb/ref 17592186082948 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083190 #edb/ref 1042 #uuid "05cffafa-cfcf-5979-a413-b7d0b66dd434" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083191 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083546 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186083191 #edb/ref 1038 #edb/ref 17592186083625 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218